Subject: [PATCH] drm/apple-g5p: account per-job GPU and host durations

[Orchard: from brkosebay/linux 9102dab8891e83f71f36ce9aa0d49b79849ab8de;
fixed source defaults, no production module controls.] Preserve the
measured opt1 chain in dependency order.

Assisted-by: LLM
